    <p class="creed-line">Test everything kindly.</p>
    <p class="muted small" style="text-align:center;max-width:52ch;margin:0 auto">
      Three words, and both halves carry weight. <em>Test</em>, because a belief you have never pressed on is
      furniture, not knowledge. <em>Kindly</em>, because the person whose idea you are pressing on is usually
      yourself, and nobody has ever thought their way clear while being sneered at — least of all by their own
      interior voice.</p>
